<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Feedback Report</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
  }
  .header-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 16pt;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .footer-text {
    font-size: 10pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 50px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .signature-block div {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #000;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 12pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-size: 11pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="logo_placeholder.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Kent Kalwar, NH-11-C,</p>
    <p>Jaipur (Rajasthan) 303002</p>
    <p>Tel: {{ contact.phone }}</p>
    <p>Fax: {{ contact.fax }}</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold;">FEEDBACK</h1>
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold;">REPORT</h1>
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ report_year }}</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Internal Quality Assurance Cell</h2>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>Kent Kalwar, NH-11-C,</p>
    <p>Jaipur (Rajasthan) 303002</p>
    <p>Tel: {{ contact.phone }}</p>
    <p>Fax: {{ contact.fax }}</p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">Feedback Analysis Report & Action Taken Report</h2>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 70%;">Feedback Type</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in feedback_types %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="feedback_types[{{ loop.index0 }}].type">{{ item.type }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Student Feedback Analysis Report {{ report_year }}</h2>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">Internal Quality Assurance Cell</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Student Feedback Analysis Report {{ report_year }}</h3>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">Range in Percentage</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">No of Faculty</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in percentage_ranges %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="percentage_ranges[{{ loop.index0 }}].range">{{ item.range }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="percentage_ranges[{{ loop.index0 }}].faculty_count">{{ item.faculty_count }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">Action Taken Report of Student Feedback {{ report_year }}</h3>

  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li>Industry integration is advised to all Board of Studies, also suggested to constitute a dedicated industry advisory council which connect domain-based experts.</li>
    <li>Strengthening of {{ resource_type }} with e-resources.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div>
      <img src="signature_placeholder.png" alt="Signature" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
      <p>Director-IQAC</p>
      <p>Amity University Rajasthan</p>
      <p>JAIPUR</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">Internal Quality Assurance Cell</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Action Taken Report of Faculty Feedback {{ report_year }}</h3>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 45%;">Parameters</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Average out of 5</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Action Taken Report</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in faculty_feedback_items %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="faculty_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].parameter">{{ item.parameter }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="faculty_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].average">{{ item.average }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="faculty_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].action_taken">{{ item.action_taken }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div>
      <img src="signature_placeholder.png" alt="Signature" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
      <p>Director-IQAC</p>
      <p>Amity University Rajasthan</p>
      <p>JAIPUR</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">Internal Quality Assurance Cell</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Analysis & Action taken Report of Employer's Feedback {{ report_year }}</h3>

  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li>Departments are instructed to corporate industry feedback in curriculum upgradation and produce industry ready graduates.</li>
    <li>Placement cell is asked for updating students about industrial processes and train them accordingly.</li>
    <li>ASCENT and AIBAS must focus on students' communication and behaviour respectively.</li>
    <li>University believes in strengthening its infrastructure and governance and committed for quality delivery.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div>
      <img src="signature_placeholder.png" alt="Signature" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
      <p>Director-IQAC</p>
      <p>Amity University Rajasthan</p>
      <p>JAIPUR</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">ALUMNI FEEDBACK ANALYSIS REPORT OF AUR</h3>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">CLASS OF {{ graduation_year }} (Convocation-{{ convocation_date }})</h3>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">DEPARTMENT</h3>
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.N</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">Parameters</th>
        {% for dept in departments %}
        <th style="width: 10%;">{{ dept.name }}</th>
        {% endfor %}
        <th style="width: 10%;">Total</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">AUR</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in alumni_feedback_items %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="alumni_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].parameter">{{ item.parameter }}</span></td>
        {% for dept in departments %}
        <td><span data-field="alumni_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].scores[{{ dept.id }}]">{{ item.scores[dept.id] }}</span></td>
        {% endfor %}
        <td><span data-field="alumni_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].total">{{ item.total }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="alumni_feedback_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].aur">{{ item.aur }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">Action Taken Report of Alumni Feedback {{ report_year }}</h3>
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 5%;">S.No</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">Parameters</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Analysis out of 10</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Action Taken Report</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in alumni_action_taken_items %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="alumni_action_taken_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].parameter">{{ item.parameter }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="alumni_action_taken_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].analysis">{{ item.analysis }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="alumni_action_taken_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].action_taken">{{ item.action_taken }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">AMITY UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">RAJASTHAN</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">PARENTS FEEDBACK ANALYSIS REPORT {{ report_year }}</h3>
