</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="header-title">AMITY UNIVERSITY RAJASTHAN</div>
    <div class="subtitle">Internal Quality Assurance Cell</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">Action Taken Report of Parent's Feedback 2017-18</div>
  </div>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">S.N.</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">Parameters</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Analysis out of 10</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Action Taken Report</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for i in range(20) %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td><span data-field="parameters[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ "Getting admission in the University for my ward is a matter of pride for me." if loop.index0 == 0 else "The admission process in the University is fair and accurate (Neat and Clean)." if loop.index0 == 1 else "My ward has improved his knowledge base through interaction with faculties of the University." if loop.index0 == 2 else "The discipline in the University is good." if loop.index0 == 3 else "The atmosphere in the University is conducive for Teaching-Learning." if loop.index0 == 4 else "There is a positive change in the behaviour of my ward after joining and studied in the University." if loop.index0 == 5 else "I have great feeling and rate the University high in my assessment" if loop.index0 == 6 else "AUR is one of the best Universities in India." if loop.index0 == 7 else "The University information is accessible to all through updated website and brochures." if loop.index0 == 8 else "Quality of food and Mess facilities are good and are adequate to house students." if loop.index0 == 9 else "The curriculum of the courses is well designed and promotes student learning objectives (SLOs). It is need based, demand driven and as per market requirement." if loop.index0 == 10 else "Employability is given focus in the curriculum design." if loop.index0 == 11 else "The curriculum incorporates recent changes/advances in the field of education and research." if loop.index0 == 12 else "Examination results are declared in time (with in 30 days)." if loop.index0 == 13 else "The University Employees are cooperative." if loop.index0 == 14 else "University bus services are good and punctual." if loop.index0 == 15 else "Hostel facilities are good and available as per requirement." if loop.index0 == 16 else "The changes introduced in the University in recent years are positive and progressive." if loop.index0 == 17 else "Sports & Gym facilities are good" if loop.index0 == 18 else "I would like to recommend this Institute/ School and University to my relatives & friends" }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="analysis_out_of_10[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ "8.25" if loop.index0 == 0 else "8.24" if loop.index0 == 1 else "8.15" if loop.index0 == 2 else "8.06" if loop.index0 == 3 else "8.05" if loop.index0 == 4 else "7.95" if loop.index0 == 5 else "7.68" if loop.index0 == 6 else "7.13" if loop.index0 == 7 else "7.94" if loop.index0 == 8 else "7.56" if loop.index0 == 9 else "8.13" if loop.index0 == 10 else "7.64" if loop.index0 == 11 else "7.68" if loop.index0 == 12 else "8.00" if loop.index0 == 13 else "7.40" if loop.index0 == 14 else "7.90" if loop.index0 == 15 else "7.88" if loop.index0 == 16 else "7.99" if loop.index0 == 17 else "7.69" if loop.index0 == 18 else "7.64" if loop.index0 == 19 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="action_taken_report[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ "Continuously quality Delivery" if loop.index0 == 0 else "Transparent & User Friendly system" if loop.index0 == 1 else "Connect HR for quality Recruitment" if loop.index0 == 2 else "Connect Proctor & Heads" if loop.index0 == 3 else "Leadership team ensures the same" if loop.index0 == 4 else "Behavioral science is mandatory for all courses" if loop.index0 == 5 else "DSW will ensure" if loop.index0 == 6 else "University belives in quality" if loop.index0 == 7 else "Focus on e-governance" if loop.index0 == 8 else "Connected with Director Administration" if loop.index0 == 9 else "IQAC ensures PO_PSO_CO assignments" if loop.index0 == 10 else "Dean Academics Connect" if loop.index0 == 11 else "Connect BOS" if loop.index0 == 12 else "Connect COE" if loop.index0 == 13 else "Connect HR for quality Recruitment" if loop.index0 == 14 else "Connect Administration" if loop.index0 == 15 else "Connect Hostel" if loop.index0 == 16 else "Leadership team ensures the same" if loop.index0 == 17 else "Sports officer will ensure" if loop.index0 == 18 else "University ensures quality exposure" if loop.index0 == 19 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div></body>
</html>